questions.questionText:
In a certain code language,

A % B means &lsquo;A is the sister of B&rsquo;

A &euro; B means &lsquo;A is the son of B&rsquo;

A = B means &lsquo;A is the father of B&rsquo;

A ? B means &lsquo;A is the daughter of B&rsquo;

Based on the above, how is B related to X if 'B % C ? O &euro; P = X'?
